==Strategy==
This stage functions on a time limit and has enemies that get stronger the more you kill them, and you gain points based on Production cost x Points multiplier. Bring as many anti angel to kill them for the most amount of event points. Mushroom and ramen are obvious choices, but use anything that can kill in a quick time and is fairly pricey for maximum points like Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] or [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]]. If you have [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]], he can be used as supplement or replacement over mushroom cat. The goal of this stage isn't to win, but to kill as much as possible with the most expensive units, so do that.

Alternatively, since the score multiplier for 5501+ is so high, one can use a lineup with a lot of expensive units to fill up the fever guage faster in order to farm more points during fever time.

